<title>USA: Broadband names David Orr president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Broadband names David Orr president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broadband Technologies Inc said on Monday David Orr will become president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Salim Bhatia, founder, president and chief executive since the company's inception, will become chairman, Broadband said.</p>
<p>Orr previously was president and chief executive officer of Alcatel Network Systems, Broadband said.</p>
<p>John Hutchins III, a founder and chairman, will become chairman emeritus and remain on the board of directors, the company said.</p>
</text>
